      "id": "dashashloki-1",
      "label": "Verse 1",
      "number": "1",
      "deva": "न भूमिर्न तोयं न तेजो न वायुः\nन खं नेन्द्रियं वा न तेषां समूहः ।\nअनेकान्तिकत्वात् सुषुप्त्येकसिद्धः\nतदेकोऽवशिष्टः शिवः केवलोऽहम् ॥",
      "translation": "I am not earth, water, fire, air, space, any sense, or their aggregate. Because these are inconstant, the one Self is established through deep sleep alone. That One remains—the auspicious, solitary One—and I am That.",
