    {
      "id": "dashashloki-2",
      "label": "Verse 2",
      "number": "2",
      "deva": "न वर्णा न वर्णाश्रमाचारधर्मा\nन मे धारणाध्यानयोगादयोऽपि ।\nअनात्माश्रयाहंममाध्यासहानात्\nतदेकोऽवशिष्टः शिवः केवलोऽहम् ॥",
      "translation": "I am not the social classes, nor the duties of class, life-stage, and conduct. Practices such as concentration, meditation, and yoga are not mine either. Having relinquished the superimposition of “I” and “mine” upon the non-Self, that auspicious One remains, and I am that One alone.",
