    {
      "id": "dashashloki-3",
      "label": "Verse 3",
      "number": "3",
      "deva": "न माता पिता वा न देवा न लोका\nन वेदा न यज्ञा न तीर्थं ब्रुवन्ति ।\nसुषुप्तौ निरस्तातिशून्यात्मकत्वात्\nतदेकोऽवशिष्टः शिवः केवलोऽहम् ॥",
      "translation": "There is no mother or father, no gods or worlds, no Vedas, sacrifices, or pilgrimage places, they say. In deep sleep, even the notion of utter voidness is negated. That One remains—the auspicious, solitary One—and I am That alone.",
